<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Two parts, two complete 4/4 bars each. Flute plays four crotchets per
     bar; Viola plays one semibreve per bar landing on beat 1, the same
     offset as the flute's first crotchet each bar. Regression fixture for
     the bug where deactivating the flute (Region 2) still forced timeline
     navigation to step through the flute's crotchet-rate slices instead of
     moving directly between the still-active viola's semibreves. -->
